token_usage": {"input_tokens": 8563, "output_tokens": 867, "total_tokens": 9430}}, "model_output": "Continue with pages 17–20 and mark extraction complete.\n\n```python\nupdate_plan([\n {\"title\": \"基线检查并读取 report.json/paper.json\", \"status\": \"done\"},\n {\"title\": \"用 read_pdf.py 提取第1-52页\", \"status\": \"done\"},\n {\"title\": \"分批阅读并写五个主题笔记\", \"status\": \"doing\"},\n {\"title\": \"复用笔记生成 report.json\", \"status\": \"todo\"},\n {\"title\": \"运行 pytest 并完成\", \"status\": \"todo\"}\n])\nprint(recall(['ev-9317b06df60c30a6c12c','ev-6297cb688893b79c33c4','ev-562f05b08e87ac882b23','ev-f5fab558c5f762a67dcc']))\n```", "code_action": "update_plan([\n {\"title\": \"基线检查并读取 report.json/paper.json\", \"status\": \"done\"},\n {\"title\": \"用 read_pdf.py 提取第1-52页\", \"status\": \"done\"},\n {\"title\": \"分批阅读并写五个主题笔记\", \"status\": \"doing\"},\n {\"title\": \"复用笔记生成 report.json\", \"status\": \"todo\"},\n {\"title\": \"运行 pytest 并完成\", \"status\": \"todo\"}\n])\nprint(recall(['ev-9317b06df60c30a6c12c','ev-6297cb688893b79c33c4','ev-562f05b08e87ac882b23','ev-f5fab558c5f762a67dcc']))", "observations": "Execution logs:\n{'requested': [{'id': 'ev-9317b06df60c30a6c12c', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:17'}, {'id': 'ev-6297cb688893b79c33c4', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:18'}, {'id': 'ev-562f05b08e87ac882b23', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:19'}, {'id': 'ev-f5fab558c5f762a67dcc', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:20'}], 'queued': [{'id': 'ev-9317b06df60c30a6c12c', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:17'}, {'id': 'ev-6297cb688893b79c33c4', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:18'}, {'id': 'ev-562f05b08e87ac882b23', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:19'}, {'id': 'ev-f5fab558c5f762a67dcc', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:20'}, {'id': 'ev-e5b9499e130a976eefe2', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:21'}, {'id': 'ev-7f4d5e2fe0886c80c09b', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:22'}, {'id': 'ev-731fa63b8d34dde45e62', 'source': 