extend this to a larger range of tools. ToolBench [Qin et al., 2023] contains 16,464 APIs from RapidAPI, a large dataset of publicly available REST APIs.\" That is continuous.\n\nWrite note tool_use with answers.\n\nAlso recall next pages 24-26."}, "logprobs": null, "finish_reason": "stop"}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 8420, "completion_tokens": 569, "total_tokens": 8989, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 4224}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 193}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 4224, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 4196}, "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}, "classification": "ok"}
