olBench 做结构化工具文档；Gorilla/APIBench 生成 API 调用。\n答案：toolformer_tools=[calculator, question_answering, search_engine, translation, calendar]；toolbench_api_count=16464。Evidence: page 23 (ev-731fa63b8d34dde45e62).\"\"\"\nprint(write_note(title='tool_use 最终笔记', content=note, evidence_ids=['ev-731fa63b8d34dde45e62'], section='tool_use'))\nprint(recall(['ev-4e747765f5046c8ad8b1','ev-daeb56e673fc61cae0ef','ev-a30e6edea79391cf315d']))\n```", "refusal": null, "role": "assistant", "annotations": null, "audio": null, "function_call": null, "tool_calls": null}}], "created": 1793334663, "model": "deepseek-flash", "object": "chat.completion", "moderation": null, "service_tier": null, "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6", "usage": {"_type": "CompletionUsage", "completion_tokens": 569, "prompt_tokens": 8420, "total_tokens": 8989, "completion_tokens_details": {"_type": "CompletionTokensDetails", "accepted_prediction_tokens": null, "audio_tokens": null, "reasoning_tokens": 193, "rejected_prediction_tokens": null}, "prompt_tokens_details": {"_type": "PromptTokensDetails", "audio_tokens": null, "cache_write_tokens": null, "cached_tokens": 4224}}, "_request_id": null}, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 8420, "output_tokens": 569, "total_tokens": 8989}}, "model_output": "Toolformer/ToolBench facts confirmed on p.23. Writing the tool_use note and queuing the next pages.\n\n```python\nnote = \"\"\"tool_use 笔记：Toolformer（Schick et al., 2023）训练模型自行决定调用哪个 API、何时调用、传什么参数、如何把结果并入后续 token 预测；测试的五种工具为 calculator、question_answering、search_engine、translation、calendar（p.23：\"A range of tools is tested: a calculator, a question-answering system, a search engine, a translation system, and a calendar.\"）。\nToolBench（Qin et al., 2023）收录 16,464 个来自 RapidAPI 的公开 REST API（p.23：\"ToolBench [Qin et al., 2023] contains 16,464 APIs from RapidAPI, a large dataset of publicly available REST APIs.\"）。对比：ToolAlpaca 3938 instances/400 APIs；EasyTool 基于 ToolBench 做结构化工具文档；Gorilla/APIBench 生成 API 调用。\n答