ue, 'page': 38, 'valid': True, 'atomic': True, 'chars': 3680, 'exposed': False}, {'id': 'ev-76027d4e758f97793930', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'version': 'b4767423c79db69ae7138f4c0aed7733af6385e0a370da21ad7d6fe029d7fb8c', 'locator': 'page:39', 'required': True, 'page': 39, 'valid': True, 'atomic': True, 'chars': 3745, 'exposed': False}, {'id': 'ev-2bcb169328f17ac85c9d', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'version': 'b4767423c79db69ae7138f4c0aed7733af6385e0a370da21ad7d6fe029d7fb8c', 'locator': 'page:40', 'required': True, 'page': 40, 'valid': True, 'atomic': True, 'chars': 1952, 'exposed': False}, {'id': 'ev-a67fb4f311d1f21c4aba', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'version': 'b4767423c79db69ae7138f4c0aed7733af6385e0a370da21ad7d6fe029d7fb8c', 'locator': 'page:41', 'required': True, 'page': 41, 'valid': True, 'atomic': True, 'chars': 2382, 'exposed': False}, {'id': 'ev-baddfbae8db75139dd16', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'version': 'b4767423c79db69ae7138f4c0aed7733af6385e0a370da21ad7d6fe029d7fb8c', 'locator': 'page:42', 'required': True, 'page': 42, 'valid': True, 'atomic': True, 'chars': 380, 'exposed': False}, {'id': 'ev-94c9aed99ffbcdf31b43', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'version': 'b4767423c79db69ae7138f4c0aed7733af6385e0a370da21ad7d6fe029d7fb8c', 'locator': 'page:43', 'required': True, 'page': 43, 'valid': True, 'atomic': True, 'chars': 3742, 'exposed': False}, {'id': 'ev-bc885ff165a165a4d614', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'version': 'b4767423c79db69ae7138f4c0aed7733af6385e0a370da21ad7d6fe029d7fb8c', 'locator': 'page:44', 'required': True, 'page': 44, 'valid': True, 'atomic': True, 'chars': 2323, 'exposed': False}, {'id': 'ev-fdbf1c532c2133190b0f', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'version': 'b4767423c79db69ae7138f4c0aed7733af6385e0a370da21ad7d6fe029d7fb8c', 'locator': 'page:45', 'required': True, 'page': 45, 'valid': True, 'atomic': True, 'chars': 4456, 'exposed': False}, {'id': 'ev-75546d247dedb90561b5', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'version': 'b4767423c79db69ae7138f4c0aed7733af6385e0a370da21ad7d6fe029d7fb8c', 'locator': 'page:46', 'required': True, 'page': 46, 'valid': True, 'atomic': True, 'chars': 4646, 'exposed': False}, {'id': 'ev-f03e4b7f1b7fc6e66886', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'version': 'b4767423c79db69ae7138f4c0aed7733af6385e0a370da21ad7d6fe029d7fb8c', 'locator': 'page:47', 'required': True, 'page': 47, 'valid': True, 'atomic': True, 'chars': 5018, 'exposed': False}, {'id': 'ev-aa9b9dbdfec8c640b495', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'version': 'b4767423c79db69ae7138f4c0aed7733af6385e0a370da21ad7d6fe029d7fb8c', 'locator': 'page:48', 'required': True, 'page': 48, 'valid': True, 'atomic': True, 'chars': 4375, 'exposed': False}, {'id': 'ev-6e64db9ec6bfa8f9417f', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'version': 'b4767423c79db69ae7138f4c0aed7733af6385e0a370da21ad7d6fe029d7fb8c', 'locator': 'page:49', 'required': True, 'page': 49, 'valid': True, 'atomic': True, 'chars': 4295, 'exposed': False}, {'id': 'ev-42cada09d7411017eb46', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'version': 'b4767423c79db69ae7138f4c0aed7733af6385e0a370da21ad7d6fe029d7fb8c', 'locator': 'page:50', 'required': True, 'page': 50, 'valid': True, 'atomic': True, 'chars': 4663, 'exposed': False}, {'id': 'ev-99f0f0a37d328bfed1a9', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'version': 'b4767423c79db69ae7138f4c0aed7733af6385e0a370da21ad7d6fe029d7fb8c', 'locator': 'page:51', 'required': True, 'page': 51, 'valid': True, 'atomic': True, 'chars': 3844, 'exposed': False}, {'id': 'ev-01ce8948bcc88d235ea3', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'version': 'b4767423c79db69ae7138f4c0aed7733af6385e0a370da21ad7d6fe029d7fb8c', 'locator': 'page:52', 'required': True, 'page': 52, 'valid': True, 'atomic': True, 'chars': 4072, 'exposed': False}], 'notes': {'overview': {'id': 'overview', 'content': 'overview 最终笔记：分类三类 =(1) reason, (2) act, (3) interact（p.1 摘要；“reasoning, acting, interacting”三类，p.3 定义“Agents that receive input in natural language from their environment, reason to make decisions, and take autonomous actions…”，p.4 说明三类相互构建、循环）。\\n文献组织：第2节 reasoning（reasoning, reflection, retrieval 改进决策）、第3节 acting（tools 与 robot 集成成 assistant）、第4节 interacting（multi-agent 交互与 agent 社会）(p.3)。\\n检索方法：先用 Google Scholar 搜 Agentic LLM，再用 snowballing 扩展被引但未收录的工作，只选 LLM-based 方法 (p.5)。\\n答案：categories=reason/act/interact；search_methods=google_scholar, snowballing。', 'sources': ['paper.pdf'], 'evidence_ids': ['ev-26c94297c50e4ef408a2', 'ev-dbca06e364385e22f3c5'], 'valid': True, 'request': 4}, 'tool_use': {'id': 'tool_use', 'content': 'tool_use 笔记：Toolformer（Schick et al., 2023）训练模型自行决定调用哪个 API、何时调用、传什么参数、如何把结果并入后续 token 预测；测试的五种工具为 calculator、question_answering、search_engine、translation、calendar（p.23：\"A range of tools is tested: a calculator, a question-answering system, a search engine, a translation system, and a calendar.\"）。\\nToolBench（Qin et al., 2023）收录 16,464 个来自 RapidAPI 的公开 REST API（p.23：\"ToolBench [Qin et al., 2023] contains 16,464 APIs from RapidAPI, a large dataset of publicly available REST APIs.\"）。对比：ToolAlpaca 3938 instances/400 APIs；EasyTool 基于 ToolBench 做结构化工具文档；Gorilla/APIBench 生成 API 调用。\\n答案：toolformer_tools=[calculator, question_answering, search_engine, translation, calendar]；toolbench_api_count=16464。Evidence: page 23 (ev-731fa63b8d34dde45e62).', 'sources': ['paper.pdf'], 'evidence_ids': ['ev-731fa63b8d34dde45e62'], 'valid': True, 'request': 11}}}\nLast output from code snippet:\nNone", "observations_images": null, "action_output": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 8910, "output_tokens": 217, "total_tokens": 9127}, "is_final_answer": false}}
