{"event": "tool_call", "time": 1793334887.5978317, "run_id": "bc66e688ffa145dab1bfd63ef2789a9b", "seq": 431, "tool": "write_note", "arguments": {"title": "reasoning 笔记（增量）", "content": "reasoning 笔记（增量，待补 Self Consistency 选答规则）：第2节把推理方法分为 prompting（CoT）、search tree、self-reflection、neurosymbolic 等。CoT 是贪婪地只走单步；Tree of Thoughts（Yao et al., 2024）建立外部控制算法，每次用不同 prompt 调用模型，使其沿推理步骤树搜索，走完一条路径后回溯尝试替代路径，论文给出 breadth-first 与 depth-first 两种控制器（p.13）。因此 tot_search=[breadth_first, depth_first]。证据（p.13）：\"When one reasoning path has been traversed, the search backtracks, and tries an alternative. The paper describes both a breadth-first and a depth-first controller.\" Self Consistency 的具体选答规则（多条路径结果如何定答案）仍待核对，下一批页到后补齐。", "evidence_ids": ["ev-4049593a30e2846f8394"], "section": "reasoning"}}
