dence_ids=['ev-4049593a30e2846f8394'],\n    section='reasoning'\n)\nprint(r)\n```", "code_action": "r = write_note(\n    title=\"reasoning 笔记（增量）\",\n    content=\"reasoning 笔记（增量，待补 Self Consistency 选答规则）：第2节把推理方法分为 prompting（CoT）、search tree、self-reflection、neurosymbolic 等。CoT 是贪婪地只走单步；Tree of Thoughts（Yao et al., 2024）建立外部控制算法，每次用不同 prompt 调用模型，使其沿推理步骤树搜索，走完一条路径后回溯尝试替代路径，论文给出 breadth-first 与 depth-first 两种控制器（p.13）。因此 tot_search=[breadth_first, depth_first]。证据（p.13）：\\\"When one reasoning path has been traversed, the search backtracks, and tries an alternative. The paper describes both a breadth-first and a depth-first controller.\\\" Self Consistency 的具体选答规则（多条路径结果如何定答案）仍待核对，下一批页到后补齐。\",\n    evidence_ids=['ev-4049593a30e2846f8394'],\n    section='reasoning'\n)\nprint(r)", "observations": "Execution logs:\n{'note_id': 'reasoning', 'sources': ['paper.pdf'], 'chars': 527}\nLast output from code snippet:\nNone", "observations_images": null, "action_output": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 8822, "output_tokens": 2329, "total_tokens": 11151}, "is_final_answer": false}}
