rgets the alternatives (Chain of Thought).\" 故 tot_search=[breadth_first, depth_first]。Self Consistency 的具体选答规则（多条路径结果如何确定最终答案）仍待第12页内容补齐。', evidence_ids=['ev-4049593a30e2846f8394'], section='reasoning'))\nr = read_pdf(51, 51)\nprint([p['page'] for p in r['pages']])\n```", "code_action": "print(write_note(title='reasoning', content='reasoning 笔记（增量）：第2节把推理方法分为 prompting（CoT）、search tree、self-reflection、neurosymbolic 等。CoT 贪婪地只走看起来最好的一步、丢弃其它选项；Tree of Thoughts（Yao et al., 2024）建立外部控制算法，用生成 prompt + 评估 prompt + 外部搜索算法系统地树形探索推理步骤，回溯后尝试替代路径，论文给出两种控制器（p.13）：\"When one reasoning path has been traversed, the search backtracks, and tries an alternative. The paper describes both a breadth-first and a depth-first controller.\" 同页：\"A greedy method selects the single step that looks best, follows only that step, and forgets the alternatives (Chain of Thought).\" 故 tot_search=[breadth_first, depth_first]。Self Consistency 的具体选答规则（多条路径结果如何确定最终答案）仍待第12页内容补齐。', evidence_ids=['ev-4049593a30e2846f8394'], section='reasoning'))\nr = read_pdf(51, 51)\nprint([p['page'] for p in r['pages']])", "observations": "Execution logs:\n{'note_id': 'reasoning', 'sources': ['paper.pdf'], 'chars': 618}\n[51]\nLast output from code snippet:\nNone", "observations_images": null, "action_output": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 7969, "output_tokens": 1328, "total_tokens": 9297}, "is_final_answer": false}}
