, self_reflection, safety]；shared_foundations=[reasoning, self_verification]。', evidence_ids=['ev-99f0f0a37d328bfed1a9','ev-01ce8948bcc88d235ea3'], section='outlook'))\nr = read_pdf(12, 12)\nprint([p['page'] for p in r['pages']])\n```", "code_action": "print(write_note(title='outlook', content='outlook 笔记（p.51–52）：Table 4 列出五个研究议题——Training Data（用推理期数据微调、稳定强化学习、VLA 与多模态）、Hallucination（self verification、mechanistic interpretability、开放世界模型探索）、Agent Behavior（可扩展仿真与角色扮演、蒸馏到小模型、agent 与人类行为建模）、Self reflection（模型内自我反思与元推理、元认知与人格、自动化科学发现）、Safety（责任与义务、隐私与数据公平、assistant 更广应用领域）(p.51)。结论：三类能力互补，reasoning 是基础，机器人交互与工具使用建立在 grounded retrieval augmentation 上，社会交互建立在 self reflection 上，\"all categories benefit from reasoning and self-verification.\" (p.52) 答案：agenda_topics=[training_data, hallucination, agent_behavior, self_reflection, safety]；shared_foundations=[reasoning, self_verification]。', evidence_ids=['ev-99f0f0a37d328bfed1a9','ev-01ce8948bcc88d235ea3'], section='outlook'))\nr = read_pdf(12, 12)\nprint([p['page'] for p in r['pages']])", "observations": "Execution logs:\n{'note_id': 'outlook', 'sources': ['paper.pdf'], 'chars': 593}\n[12]\nLast output from code snippet:\nNone", "observations_images": null, "action_output": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 8699, "output_tokens": 1067, "total_tokens": 9766}, "is_final_answer": false}}
